    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d379">

                <pb facs="0677" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p1/pg659"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856D.13/5–2151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Indonesia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cochran</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Djakarta</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-05-21T18:00:00+07:30">May 21, 1951—6 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1624. Djuanda told me 21st that mtg Econ Fin Comite 17th question gold sales not
                    discussed. He said responsible authorities Indo
                    Govt now so generally opposed to this idea that he convinced it will be
                    abandoned without necessity Cabinet decision (see Embtel 1603).<anchor n="1" xml:id="d379-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cochran</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
